# rules/ — Pinned Semgrep OSS rule packs (security-audit pipeline, Directive 2 reproducibility pin).
#
# INTERMEDIATE artifact. At audit runtime the Layer 2 SAST step materializes the
# three registry rule packs into this directory for reproducible scans, e.g.:
#   semgrep --metrics=off --config=p/security-audit --dump-config > rules/
#   semgrep --metrics=off --config=p/secrets        --dump-config > rules/
#   semgrep --metrics=off --config=p/owasp-top-ten  --dump-config > rules/
#
# The dumped packs are generated deterministically by the Semgrep CLI from the
# external semgrep.dev registry (not hand-authored, not in-repo source), so they
# are NOT committed. This .gitignore keeps the otherwise-empty directory tracked
# in version control while excluding all generated rule content.
#
# Ignore everything in this directory except this .gitignore itself.
*
!.gitignore
